    "answer": {
      "short": "$6+2\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3+2\\sqrt6$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3)^2&=1^2+(\\sqrt2)^2+(\\sqrt3)^2+2\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3+2\\sqrt2\\sqrt3\\\\(1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3)^2&=1+2+3+2\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3+2\\sqrt6\\\\(1+\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3)^2&=6+2\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3+2\\sqrt6\\end{align*}$$",
